@startuml
!include theme.iuml
left to right direction
title Assignment user goals and retained identity/recovery
actor "Visitor (signed out)" as Visitor
actor "Group member / private account owner" as Member
actor "Email service" as Mail
actor "Google identity service" as Google
rectangle "Mboa non-AI compiler workspace" {
  usecase "Register / verify / sign in /\nrecover account" as Account
  usecase "Optional Google sign-in /\nexplicit account linking" as OAuth
  usecase "Manage private projects" as Projects
  usecase "Save exact manual statements\nand provenance" as Collect
  usecase "Record / attach / play audio" as Audio
  usecase "Review lexical annotations" as Review
  usecase "Preview local text documents" as Import
  usecase "Read dictionary / constructed practice" as Reference
  usecase "Tokenize corpus and inspect\nfrequency / variation / phrases" as Lexical
  usecase "Construct and justify own-data CFG" as CFG
  usecase "Compute transformations,\nFIRST/FOLLOW and LL(1) table" as Grammar
  usecase "Parse own tokenized inputs\nand inspect accept/reject traces" as Parse
  usecase "Upload genuine screenshots;\nauthor profile / discussion" as Evidence
  usecase "Export DRAFT report / slides /\nsource and analysis artifacts" as Export
  usecase "Read/export preserved legacy history" as History
  usecase "Restore entry revisions" as Revision
  usecase "Create / schedule / download backup" as Backup
  usecase "Preview and confirm workspace restore" as Restore
  usecase "Validate archive integrity\nand data bounds" as Validate
}
Visitor -- Account
Visitor -- OAuth
Member -- OAuth
Member -- Projects
Member -- Collect
Member -- Audio
Member -- Review
Member -- Import
Member -- Reference
Member -- Lexical
Member -- CFG
Member -- Grammar
Member -- Parse
Member -- Evidence
Member -- Export
Member -- History
Member -- Revision
Member -- Backup
Member -- Restore
Mail -- Account
Google -- OAuth
Parse ..> Grammar : <<include>>
Export ..> Lexical : <<include>>
Export ..> Grammar : <<include>>
Backup ..> Validate : <<include>>
Restore ..> Validate : <<include>>
note bottom of Member
  Three names describe the assignment group,
  not shared-team access permissions.
  Each private goal requires a verified account.
end note
legend bottom
  Include points to mandatory reused behavior; no dependency is decorated with cardinalities.
  Import/reference lookup never automatically saves or authenticates a field statement.
  Real listening/manual transcription, final pagination and presentation rehearsal remain human work.
  No AI, translation, chat, OCR, remote transcription or browser dictation use case exists.
endlegend
@enduml
